### Auto
path: "borrow_view.at"
```auto
// Test view (immutable borrow) expression
fn main() {
    let s = "hello"
    let slice = s.view
    print(str_len(slice))
    print(s)  // s is still valid after view
}
```

### Rust
check-id: "a2c-emit"

#### borrow_view.expected.c
```c
#include "borrow_view.h"

int main(void) {
    char* s = "hello";
    char* slice = &(s);
    printf("%d\n", str_len(slice));
    printf("%s\n", s);
    return 0;
}
```

